    "items": [
     {
      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "Fortress Fun is a twin-tower castle with a tube slide and a climbing wall. It comes in three colour pairs: Cherry Red and Baby Blue, Mango Yellow and Forest Green, or Baby Blue and Knight Blue. That choice helps if you want the play area to match a building facade or a school's colours. It is built for children aged 3 to 12, so younger and older siblings can use it together, with play focused on climbing and sliding. The footprint is close to square at 25'5\" x 25'2\", and it needs a safe play area of 30'5\" x 30'2\". Capacity is listed as 15 children. The galvanised pipes, roto-moulded parts, composite laminates and play rope on Fortress Fun are covered for 3 years. Ask us for a layout drawing in the colour pair you prefer."
     }
    ]
   }
